    <pubDate>Tue, 17 Jun 2025 01:00:21 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>大家早上好！之前在生活中发现了周围很多吵架的事情！因为停车位吵架啊，因为买东西吵架呀。Vctalk的各位在生活中有遇到什么会吵架的事情吗？是怎么度过的呢？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="449">07:29</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;遇到了很严重的冲突，大家会怎么面对？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="640">10:40</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;花花姐曾经超级无敌生气的时刻！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="841">14:01</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;遇到了吵过架有隔阂的人，会怎么办 ？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1701">28:21</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;大家有和外卖小哥产生过什么矛盾嘛</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1741">29:01</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;遇到喷了浓烈香水，开车时快时慢，边开边打电话的臭车司机怎么办？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2183">36:23</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;琦姐打车遇到过的惊险时刻！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2399">39:59</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;听众们分享的吵架时刻</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2509">41:49</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;大家会和自己的家人吵架吗？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3341">55:41</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;大家要勇敢地和心思不善良、歹毒的人争执（吵架）！！！</span></strong></p>]]></description>
