  <item>
    <title>VCtalk16-新手妈妈的打怪升级之路！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67d4f1130766616acd11a04f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67d4f1130766616acd11a04f</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 15 Mar 2025 03:28:01 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>迎来了新的一期！这次我们请到了两位我们熟悉的好朋友～马老师和喵酱！我们三个是处于不同时期的妈妈，在照顾孩子，成为母亲的道路上会遇到什么困难呢？大家又是怎么解决的呢？请听这次的电台～</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="35">00:35</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;神秘选手介绍~</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="155">02:35</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;刚刚怀孕的时候心里会有什么变化</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="617">10:17</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;怀孕的时候和生下来之后哪个阶段更辛苦呢？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1047">17:27</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;在选择生育和照顾孩子这件事上会受到网上的影响吗？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1202">20:02</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;大家会想要去成为一个什么样的母亲？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1962">32:42</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;大家的队友是什么样的呢，有起到爸爸的作用吗？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2552">42:32</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;孩子说：要吃薯片冰淇淋，要看电视，非要买玩具，大家怎么办？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3042">50:42</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;给未来会成为妈妈的听众的建议</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3418">56:58</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;如何不让小朋友产生不配得感</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3621">1:00:21</a> &nbsp;会希望自己的小朋友将来成为什么样的人吗</span></strong></p>]]></description>
