  <item>
    <title>VCTALK15 25年新感悟是要把大家当npc？这么晚的年终总结对吗？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67cb8e44e924d4525a11affb</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67cb8e44e924d4525a11affb</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 08 Mar 2025 00:31:08 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>Hello大家好！没想到吧！后面这一期这么快就来了！这次总没人催更了吧！不过这个内容好像有点点，过时？？？？？怎么回事！！！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>咳咳，大家就当现在是24年年终吧！让我们总结一下24年我们干了啥，25年有什么新的目标！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>下一期的主题是，新手妈妈们的打怪升级哦！大家猜猜会有谁呢～</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="40">00:40</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;本期主题是什么呢？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="132">02:12</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;大家24年有什么实现了的目标？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="449">07:29</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;24年大家都绕不开的一件事情</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="672">11:12</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;小屎姐姐被求婚了！？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="794">13:14</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;想问问大家2024有没有看演唱会呀？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="830">13:50</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;资深参参深深爱上了追星这件事</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1000">16:40</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;演唱会上引起歌手注意的奇招？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1202">20:02</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;琦姐强推的演唱会！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1248">20:48</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2024旅行总结！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1510">25:10</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;花花姐去好几次日本是因为一部电影？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2148">35:48</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;琦姐工作一年的感受</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2370">39:30</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;花花姐24年好像变i了</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2775">46:15</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;花花姐分享2025年的新感悟！！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3200">53:20</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;琦姐分享新的感悟！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3480">58:00</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;如何摆脱焦虑的状态？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3847">1:04:07</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2025年大家有什么新的展望呢？</span></strong></p>]]></description>
