  <item>
    <title>VCTALK14普吉岛之旅与破碎塑料姐妹情！又又又碎掉啦！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67b927af606e5c59400a72a5</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67b927af606e5c59400a72a5</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 22 Feb 2025 01:37:02 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>HELLO！好久不见！！真是一次久违的，拖了很久的，都快有一年了的电台啊！所以这次说的是一年之前的事情。不过开心的是，这次的电台真的很有意思！在一片欢声笑语中，回顾我们那破碎的普吉岛之旅，没想到吧，我们四个人出去，居然这么的稀碎！</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎收听这次的VCTALK！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="106">01:46</a> 普吉岛之旅第一天！！！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="322">05:22</a> 海边度假自带泳池酒店的订购建议~</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="413">06:53</a> 戴戴姐掉水里了！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="844">14:04</a> 第二天！！！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="922">15:22</a> 琦姐过敏了！？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1082">18:02</a> 巨巨巨巨巨好吃的排骨！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1141">19:01</a> 第三天！！！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1330">22:10</a>非常推荐大家去吃的餐厅</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1430">23:50</a> 我们还两度起了争执！？来帮忙评评理！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1821">30:21</a> 第二次争执！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1884">31:24</a>大家出去玩，钱要不要都放在一个人那？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1865">31:5</a>泰国上厕所要钱！？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2100">35:00</a>神仙半岛去不去？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2203">36:43</a> 为什么你们有这么多老板？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2267">37:47</a>第四天！！！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2550">42:30</a> 潜水的体验~</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3011">50:11</a>在泰国出门吃饭没带钱！？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3243">54:03</a> 最后一天！！！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3437">57:17</a>琦姐关于和朋友旅行的小小建议</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3553">59:13</a> 下一次出行会去哪里呢？</span></strong></p>]]></description>
